        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 25 at 7:09PM MDT until September 25 at 7:15PM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>Flood waters have receded. The heavy rain has ended. Flash flooding
is no longer expected to pose a threat. Please continue to heed any
remaining road closures, and stay away from rivers that will continue
to see fast flows of water.
</description>
